# Update Database Rule

1. Review current database rule to ensure it aligns with the new decision to migrate from PostgreSQL to MongoDB.
2. Modify the existing `.cursor/rules/database.mdc` file to reflect the migration decision and remove any references to PostgreSQL.
3. Set `fme_contradiction_count` to `1` to supersede the prior PostgreSQL rule.
